---
interface Props {
  type: 'waves' | 'apis' | 'disposable' | 'architecture' | 'residue' | 'neurosymbolic';
  context?: 'slab' | 'article';
}

const { type, context = 'article' } = Astro.props;
const uid = `diag-${type}-${context}`;

const waves = [
  {
    num: '01',
    name: 'Human to Chatbot',
    status: 'Mature',
    detail: 'Bounded support and Q&A inside a single brand channel. Clear user expectation, low protocol complexity.',
  },
  {
    num: '02',
    name: 'Agent Outbound to Human',
    status: 'Scaling',
    detail: 'Automated voice and messaging initiated by businesses. Familiar channels, rising pressure on verification and consent.',
  },
  {
    num: '03',
    name: 'Agents on Human Channels',
    status: 'Breaking now',
    detail: 'Personal agents use email, WhatsApp, and phone lines built for people. Neither side reliably knows if the other end is human or software.',
  },
  {
    num: '04',
    name: 'Machine to Machine',
    status: 'Missing',
    detail: 'Direct structured negotiation with verifiable identity, authority limits, and enforceable commitments across the long tail.',
  },
];
---

{type === 'waves' && context === 'slab' && (
  <div class="wave-schematic" data-wave-widget={uid}>
    <div class="wave-schematic-head">
      <span class="wave-schematic-title">Four Parallel Waves of Agent Traffic</span>
      <span class="wave-schematic-title">Select layer</span>
    </div>
    <div class="wave-rows" role="tablist" aria-label="Agent traffic waves">
      {waves.map((w, idx) => (
        <button
          type="button"
          class={`wave-row ${idx === 2 ? 'active' : ''}`}
          data-wave-btn
          data-detail={w.detail}
          aria-selected={idx === 2 ? 'true' : 'false'}
        >
          <span class="wave-num">{w.num}</span>
          <span class="wave-name">{w.name}</span>
          <span class="wave-status">{w.status}</span>
        </button>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="wave-detail" data-wave-detail>
      {waves[2].detail}
    </div>
  </div>
)}

{type === 'waves' && context === 'article' && (
  <figure class="diagram-figure">
    <div class="wave-schematic" data-wave-widget={uid}>
      <div class="wave-schematic-head">
        <span class="wave-schematic-title">Four Parallel Waves of Agent Traffic</span>
        <span class="wave-schematic-title">Select layer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wave-rows" role="tablist" aria-label="Agent traffic waves">
        {waves.map((w, idx) => (
          <button
            type="button"
            class={`wave-row ${idx === 2 ? 'active' : ''}`}
            data-wave-btn
            data-detail={w.detail}
            aria-selected={idx === 2 ? 'true' : 'false'}
          >
            <span class="wave-num">{w.num}</span>
            <span class="wave-name">{w.name}</span>
            <span class="wave-status">{w.status}</span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="wave-detail" data-wave-detail>
        {waves[2].detail}
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="diagram-caption">Figure: Communication layers stack rather than replace one another. Select any wave to inspect where current infrastructure holds or breaks.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

{type === 'apis' && (
  <figure class="diagram-figure">
    <div class="diagram-frame">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 800 260" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Primitives versus provider authority boundary in API design">
        <rect x="20" y="24" width="330" height="212" fill="#091529" stroke="#1E3A66" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <rect x="20" y="24" width="330" height="36" fill="#0E2242" />
        <text x="38" y="47" fill="#67A4FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">CALLER + CODING MODEL</text>
        <text x="38" y="88" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="600">Composable Primitives</text>
        <text x="38" y="112" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">Models write integration code reliably when</text>
        <text x="38" y="130" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">building blocks are clear and stable.</text>
        <rect x="38" y="152" width="142" height="30" fill="#050B16" stroke="#284A80" />
        <text x="50" y="171" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="11">create_workspace()</text>
        <rect x="190" y="152" width="142" height="30" fill="#050B16" stroke="#284A80" />
        <text x="206" y="171" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="11">add_users()</text>
        <text x="38" y="212" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">GLUE ABSTRACTION: LOW VALUE</text>

        <line x1="400" y1="16" x2="400" y2="244" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
        <rect x="364" y="114" width="72" height="28" fill="#00E5FF" />
        <text x="400" y="132" text-anchor="middle" fill="#040914" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">BOUNDARY</text>

        <rect x="450" y="24" width="330" height="212" fill="#0A1B36" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <rect x="450" y="24" width="330" height="36" fill="#0E2952" />
        <text x="468" y="47" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="600">PROVIDER AUTHORITY &amp; PRIVATE DATA</text>
        <text x="468" y="88" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="600">Justified High-Level APIs</text>
        <text x="468" y="112" fill="#A6C0DB" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">Keep abstraction where the provider holds</text>
        <text x="468" y="130" fill="#A6C0DB" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">information or authority the caller lacks.</text>
        <rect x="468" y="152" width="294" height="30" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.45)" />
        <text x="480" y="171" fill="#F4F8FC" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="11">routing + live cost + fraud + opt-outs</text>
        <text x="468" y="212" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">CAPABILITY ABSTRACTION: HIGH VALUE</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="diagram-caption">Figure: Separate convenience wrappers from abstractions backed by private provider state or compliance authority.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

{type === 'disposable' && (
  <figure class="diagram-figure">
    <div class="diagram-frame">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 800 250" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Persistent intent and tests containing disposable AI-generated implementations">
        <rect x="20" y="24" width="240" height="202" fill="#0A1B36" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="38" y="54" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">PERSISTENT ASSETS</text>
        <rect x="38" y="72" width="204" height="38" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.35)" />
        <text x="50" y="95" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="500">1. Explicit Intent &amp; Specs</text>
        <rect x="38" y="122" width="204" height="38" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.35)" />
        <text x="50" y="145" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="500">2. Stable Interface Contracts</text>
        <rect x="38" y="172" width="204" height="38" fill="rgba(0,229,255,0.08)" stroke="rgba(0,229,255,0.35)" />
        <text x="50" y="195" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13" font-weight="500">3. Behavioral Test Suite</text>

        <line x1="260" y1="125" x2="328" y2="125" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="2" />
        <polygon points="328,120 338,125 328,130" fill="#00E5FF" />
        <text x="296" y="114" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">GENERATE</text>

        <rect x="344" y="42" width="210" height="166" fill="#091529" stroke="#3B82F6" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4" />
        <text x="362" y="72" fill="#67A4FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">DISPOSABLE LAYER</text>
        <text x="362" y="102" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="15" font-weight="600">Implementation Code</text>
        <text x="362" y="126" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">Regenerated on demand when</text>
        <text x="362" y="144" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">requirements or models change.</text>
        <text x="362" y="182" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">BYPRODUCT, NOT ASSET</text>

        <line x1="554" y1="125" x2="612" y2="125" stroke="#67A4FF" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <polygon points="612,120 622,125 612,130" fill="#67A4FF" />

        <rect x="626" y="54" width="154" height="142" fill="#0D2140" stroke="#284A80" />
        <text x="642" y="84" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">VERIFICATION</text>
        <text x="642" y="112" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="14" font-weight="600">Coverage Review</text>
        <text x="642" y="136" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12">Verify edge cases,</text>
        <text x="642" y="154" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12">constraints, and</text>
        <text x="642" y="172" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12">clean boundaries.</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="diagram-caption">Figure: When code is cheap to regenerate, engineering effort moves into contracts, behavioral tests, and containment boundaries.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

{type === 'architecture' && (
  <figure class="diagram-figure">
    <div class="diagram-frame">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 800 260" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Decoupled mobile applications communicating with standalone components over an internal messaging bus">
        <rect x="30" y="22" width="220" height="52" fill="#091529" stroke="#284A80" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="140" y="45" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600">Product App A</text>
        <text x="140" y="63" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">FLUTTER SINGLE CODEBASE</text>

        <rect x="290" y="22" width="220" height="52" fill="#091529" stroke="#284A80" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="400" y="45" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600">Product App B</text>
        <text x="400" y="63" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">FLUTTER SINGLE CODEBASE</text>

        <rect x="550" y="22" width="220" height="52" fill="#091529" stroke="#284A80" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="660" y="45" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600">Product App C</text>
        <text x="660" y="63" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">FLUTTER SINGLE CODEBASE</text>

        <line x1="140" y1="74" x2="140" y2="112" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <line x1="400" y1="74" x2="400" y2="112" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <line x1="660" y1="74" x2="660" y2="112" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" />

        <rect x="30" y="112" width="740" height="40" fill="#0D264A" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="400" y="137" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="12" letter-spacing="1.5">INTERNAL MESSAGING BUS · EXPLICIT CONTRACTS</text>

        <line x1="155" y1="152" x2="155" y2="188" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <line x1="400" y1="152" x2="400" y2="188" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <line x1="645" y1="152" x2="645" y2="188" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.5" />

        <rect x="30" y="188" width="230" height="52" fill="#0A1F3D" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="145" y="211" text-anchor="middle" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600">Authentication Component</text>
        <text x="145" y="229" text-anchor="middle" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">CONFIGURABLE PER BRAND</text>

        <rect x="285" y="188" width="230" height="52" fill="#091529" stroke="#284A80" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="400" y="211" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600">Payments &amp; Account Core</text>
        <text x="400" y="229" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">INDEPENDENT RELEASES</text>

        <rect x="540" y="188" width="230" height="52" fill="#091529" stroke="#284A80" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="655" y="211" text-anchor="middle" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600">Shared Feature Modules</text>
        <text x="655" y="229" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6780A3" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10">ZERO CROSS-APP QUEUES</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="diagram-caption">Figure: Moving shared capabilities into bounded components behind an internal bus removes cross-team release bottlenecks.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

{type === 'residue' && (
  <figure class="diagram-figure">
    <div class="diagram-frame">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 800 220" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="How public residue flows into LLM synthesis and vendor selection">
