        <text x="36" y="60" fill="#67A4FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">01 · PUBLIC RESIDUE</text>
        <text x="36" y="88" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13">• API documentation clarity</text>
        <text x="36" y="112" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13">• Working code examples</text>
        <text x="36" y="136" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13">• Open-source &amp; forum traces</text>
        <text x="36" y="160" fill="#F1F6FF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="13">• Cross-source consistency</text>

        <line x1="245" y1="110" x2="294" y2="110" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.8" />
        <polygon points="294,105 304,110 294,115" fill="#00E5FF" />

        <rect x="308" y="34" width="204" height="152" fill="#0A1F3D" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="326" y="60" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">02 · MODEL SYNTHESIS</text>
        <text x="326" y="92" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="14.5" font-weight="600">No Vibes. Only Trace.</text>
        <text x="326" y="118" fill="#A6C0DB" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">Stale signals cause</text>
        <text x="326" y="136" fill="#A6C0DB" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">signal drift across coding</text>
        <text x="326" y="154" fill="#A6C0DB" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">and buyer queries.</text>

        <line x1="512" y1="110" x2="561" y2="110" stroke="#00E5FF" stroke-width="1.8" />
        <polygon points="561,105 571,110 561,115" fill="#00E5FF" />

        <rect x="575" y="34" width="205" height="152" fill="#0D2140" stroke="#284A80" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="592" y="60" fill="#00E5FF" font-family="Geist Mono, monospace" font-size="10.5">03 · DEBUG LOOP</text>
        <text x="592" y="92" fill="#FFFFFF" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="14.5" font-weight="600">Inspect &amp; Fix Gaps</text>
        <text x="592" y="118" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">Query models cold, trace</text>
        <text x="592" y="136" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">why rivals get picked, and</text>
        <text x="592" y="154" fill="#98B2D4" font-family="Geist, sans-serif" font-size="12.5">repair the missing trace.</text>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="diagram-caption">Figure: Reputation becomes debuggable once you inspect the public residue models actually synthesize.</figcaption>
  </figure>
)}

